MultiNEC	28.5	ft	in	SLT30	*** DO NOT MAKE MANUAL EDITS TO THIS FILE ***

_1000	"_Applied (input) power, watts"				
_#N/A	"_Load power, watts (calculated)"	_LoadPower = LoadAmps^2 * LoadR and			
	"_   Note that ""D"" and ""J"" are"	_with a 1A source SrcPower = 1A^2 * SrcR = SrcR.			
	"_   *calculated*, not set directly."	"_So load power at ""B"" watts input = LoadAmps^2 * LoadR * (B / SrcR)."			
	_   See Calculate sheet for values.	_(Also see note below on row 29.)			
	_   Will always show here as #N/A.				
_#N/A	"_Load loss, dB (calculated)"	_ =-10 * LOG10(1 - (LoadPower / InputPower))			
		"_Formulas to set ""D"" and ""J"" are on the Calculate sheet."			
_89.24	"_Wire length, feet"				
_7.8	"_Wire spacing, inches"				
_15	"_Tilt angle, deg, down from horizontal"				
_50	"_Height, feet, top wire (top end if tilted)"				

_820	"_Load (terminating) resistor, ohms"				
_16	_Transformer Port 2 Rel Z (Ratio 1:S)							

		_Note:  As an alternative you could set the input power level via						
		_EZNEC Options > Power Level and then *NOT* apply correction						
		"_factor ""(B / SrcR)"" to the calculated load power since EZNEC will"						
		_have adjusted the reported LoadAmps already.						

	_Terminated Folded Dipole							
	"_Wires are in over/under configuration, can be rotated down by any angle and elevated to any height."							
	"_Top and bottom wires are ""L"" feet long, spacing between wires is ""M"" inches converted to feet."							
	"_Start with wires oriented horizontally, top wire (#2, row 15) at Z=0."							
